  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CARITAS EL FARO in Argentina, implemented by Caritas, aims to improve access to essential services for marginalized communities. The objectives are to build new premises for Caritas closer to vulnerable populations, enhancing their access to food, clothing, and social assistance. Key activities include constructing a facility in a high-need area, improving service delivery and outreach, and collaborating with the local parish and community leaders to provide comprehensive support.</narrative>
  </description>
